          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balak otimo paka Balam owaco; aka Balak kodi Balam jomiyo thwon kodi wod rombo i wi kisi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balam owaco ri Balak ni, “Cungi cegin gi mic perin awaŋa, kareno akadho poyi Rwoth laromo kodan. To wac moro je ma Rwoth onyuthan, meno ama alawaco rin.” Ameno Balam okadho kamabor ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were oromo gi Balam, aka Balam owaco rigo ni, “Atieko geto migame abirio, t'amiyo i wi kisi migam thwon kodi wod rombo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oketho wac i dhok Balam, aka owaco rigo ni, “Gik bongi Balak, aka me a gim'iripo waco.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Balam ogik bongi Balak, m'oyido ocungo cegin gi mic pere awaŋa kanyacel gi jodhum je ma Mowab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
