          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balam ogik bongi Balak, kama go oyido ocung'iye cegin gi mic pere awaŋa kanyacel gi jodhum je ma Mowab. Balak openjo Balam ni, “Aŋo ma Rwoth owaco?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
